WEBVTT

00:35.487 --> 00:40.069
White-tiled walls and a buzzing light A heavy

00:40.089 --> 00:45.090
door locked up so tight My body's weak, my needs

00:45.310 --> 00:49.812
are clear But that's not why you brought me here

00:50.192 --> 00:54.973
The hunger's now and thirst is real But all I'm

00:55.013 --> 01:00.115
