01:26.329 --> 01:28.370
skull I can hear

01:31.038 --> 01:36.530
There's no escape, no way to flee.

01:41.574 --> 01:46.135
And now the screaming finally starts Tearing

01:46.495 --> 01:50.856
all my seams apart It's all my fault, this whole

01:50.936 --> 01:55.937
cursed trip The poison dripping from your lip

01:56.037 --> 01:59.758
The walls are closing, tile and steel This

01:59.918 --> 02:04.359
