02:14.364 --> 02:20.830
Just let me be invisible Just let me crawl under a

02:20.851 --> 02:26.396
stone Your voice is razor indivisible Just

02:26.536 --> 02:33.083
leave me, leave me all alone Inside this past, go

02:33.263 --> 02:34.625
lock and key

02:37.307 --> 02:42.452
There's no escape, no way to flee

